#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame/scripts.inc:82
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame_Text_HereWeHonorLeagueChampions"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: This room…\p"
"This is where we keep records of\n"
"POKéMON that prevailed through\l"
"harsh battles.\p"
"It is here that the LEAGUE CHAMPIONS\n"
"are honored.$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：这个房间……\p"
"这里记录着历经激烈对战\n"
"并取得胜利的宝可梦。\p"
"联盟冠军们\n"
"就是在这里受到表彰的。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame/scripts.inc:90
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame_Text_LetsRecordYouAndYourPartnersNames"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: Come on, let's record your\n"
"name as a TRAINER who triumphed over\l"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE, and the names of\l"
"the partners who battled with you.$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：来吧，把你作为战胜\n"
"宝可梦联盟的训练家的名字，\l"
"以及和你一起战斗的伙伴们的\l"
"名字记录下来吧。$"
